  "verseCount": 68,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gweth miyudo kuom rito chik",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka uluoro Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu kendo urito adimba chikene duto ma amiyou kawuono, to Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu biro tingʼou malo moloyo ogendini duto modak e piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwethgi duto nobed magu kamoro amora ma untie ka uluoro Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu, kendo magi e gin:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pm"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibiro gwedhou ka un e dala kata ka un oko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pm"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nogwedhu gi nyithindo mangʼeny gi cham mogundho kod jamni mathoth ma gin kweth mag nyiroye kod mag nyirombe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pm"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nogwedh atongeu gi dakuondeu duto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pm"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nogwedhu ka udonjo e dala kendo ka uwuok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye noket wasiku ma monjou e lwetu mi unulogi. Ginimonju ka gin oganda achiel, to ginike ka gia iru ka gin migepe abiriyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye biro gwedho decheu kaachiel gi gimoro amora ma uchiworu timo, Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu biro gwedhou e piny ma omiyou.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye biro gurou kaka joge maler, mana kaka ne owacho ka okwongʼore, ka urito chike mag Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu kendo uwuotho e yorene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka ji duto modak e piny none ni un joma oluong gi nying Jehova Nyasaye kendo gibiro luorou.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye biro miyou gweth mogundho; ma gin nyithindo mangʼeny, jamni mathoth kod cham mogundho e piny mane Jehova Nyasaye osingore kokwongʼore ni kwereu ni nomiu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye biro yawo polo, ma en kar keno mag mwandune, ka ochiwo koth e piny e ndalo mowinjore, kendo ka ogwedho tije duto mag lwetu. Ubiro chiwo hola ne pinje mangʼeny to un ok unuhol gimoro kuomgi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye nomi ubed jotelo to ok joma itelonegi. Ka urito chike ma Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu miyou kawuononi kendo uluwogi adimba, to kinde duto unubed jotelo to ok joma itelonegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kik uwe chike ma amiyou kawuononi, ka udhi e bat korachwich kata koracham kendo ka uluwo nyiseche manono kendo utiyonegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwongʼ miyudo kuom tamruok rito chik",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka ok uchiwo luor ne Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu kendo ok urito chikene duto adimba kod buchene ma amiyou kawuononi, to kwongʼ-gi duto biro makou.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pm"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibiro kwongʼou ka un e dala kata ka un oko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pm"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nokwongʼ atongeu gi dakuondeu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pm"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyithindu munywolo nokwongʼ, kaachiel gi chambu, gi nyiroye mag dhou kod nyithi jambu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pm"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibiro kwongʼou ka udonjo kendo kuwuok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye biro oronu kwongʼ, ngʼengʼ kod achaya e gimoro amora ma utimo, nyaka urum chuth makaru lal nono nikech richo ma usetimo ma ujwangʼe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye biro goyou gi tuoche mi otieku e piny ma udhi kawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye nogou gi tuo mar kahera, midhusi gi tuo akuodi kod gwonyo kendo obiro kelonu oro mi cham rochre ewi dongo; kendo gigo duto biro thagou nyaka urum chuth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Polo norieny ka mula ewiu, piny to nobed matek ka chuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye enolok koth machwe e pinyu obed mana lo kod buru malich, gini olre koa e polo nyaka unurum.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye nomi lou e nyim wasiku. Unumonjgi ka un e achiel, to unuring-gi kuke e migepe abiriyo, kendo unubed gima wichkuot ne ogendini duto manie piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ringreu modongʼ ema nobed chiemb winy manie kor polo gi ondiegi manie thim, kendo onge ngʼato angʼata manogolgi kuomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye nogou gi tuo mag buche mag Misri, akuodi, gwonyo kod kalanga ma ok thiedhi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye nogou gi tuo mar neko kendo noloku muofni kendo joma orundore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E dier odiechiengʼ tir ubiro rundoru ka muofni e mudho. Onge gima unutim manodhi maber, ndalo duto nothiru kendo noyak giu maonge ngʼama noresu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inichan kendo nyako mihero, to ngʼat moro nono ema nokawe mabed kode. Iniger ot to ok inidagie, kendo inipidh mzabibu to ok inicham gik monyak kuomgi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwadhi noyangʼ kineno, to ok ni cham ringe. Kanyna mari nokaw kuomi githuon, to ok noduognigo. Rombe magi nomi wasiki, to onge ngʼama noresgi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawuoti kod nyigi noter e pinje mamoko, kendo inimanygi gi wengeni odiechiengʼ duto kionge gi teko mar resogi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oganda ma ok ingʼeyo nocham gik mitiyo matek gi luchi e puotheni kendo onge gima initim makmana tingʼ mapek kod achune e ndalou duto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gik ma wangʼi neno noloki neko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye nomi buche maremo ma ok thiedhi mak chongeni gi tiendeni kendo ginilandre koa e pat tiendi nyaka e wiyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye biro riembou, to ruoth ma unuyier notelnu noteru e lwet piny ma kata kwereu ne ok ongʼeyo. Kuno unulamie nyiseche mamoko, ma gin nyiseche mopa gi yien kod kite.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inibed gima mono miyanyo kendo ijaro e kind ogendini duto kuma Jehova Nyasaye noterue.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unuchwo kothe mangʼeny to unuka manok, nikech bonyo nokethgi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unupidh mzabibu e puotheu ma ukagi to ok unumadh olemo mochwer kuomgi kata choko olembgigo nikech kute nochamgi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubiro bedo kod yien zeituni e pinyu to ok unukonyru gi moe nikech zeituni nolwar piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unubed gi yawuowi kod nyiri to ok unuritgi nimar notergi e twech e pinje mamoko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kweth mag bonyo noketh yiendu kod chambu duto e pinyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jopinje mamoko modak e pinyu nonyaa mamedre moloyou, to un to unubed manok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ginibed gi gik ma giholou, to un ok nubed gi gima unyalo hologi. Ginibed jotelo, to un nubed joma itelonegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwongʼ-gi duto nobi kuomu. Kwongʼ-gi nolaw bangʼu mijuku manyaka urum uduto, nikech ne ok uwinjo Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu, kata rito chikene kod buchene duto mane omiyou.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ginibed ranyisi kod midhiero kuomu kod nyikwau nyaka chiengʼ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikech ne ok utiyo ne Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu gi ilo kod mor e ndalo mane un gi mwandu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omiyo e kech, e riyo, e duk, kod dhier unutine wasiku ma Jehova Nyasaye oseoronu. Enoket jok mar mula mapek e ngʼutu nyaka chop otieku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye enokel piny moro moa mabor, ma en piny mantie e giko piny, machal gi ongo mafuyo, gin oganda ma dhogi ok unuwinji,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oganda maneno makwiny maonge gi luor ne joma oti kata joma pod tindo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ginineg jambu ma pod tindo kendo giniketh chambu e puothe mi nyaka ginitieku chuth. Ok ginicham, divai manyien kata mo, kata mana nyiroye mag dhou kod nyirombe mag jambu nyaka chop gitieku chuth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ginitim agengʼa ne miechu madongo duto nyaka kuonde mochiel motingʼore gi malo ma uketo genou kuomgi lwar. Ginikethi mier madongo e piny duto ma Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu miyou.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikech chandruok maniyudi ka wasiki okeloni ka in e twech, nucham nyaka nyithindu munywolo, ma gin ringre yawuotu kod nyiu ma Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu osemiyou.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata mana ngʼat maber kendo ngʼwon ahinya e dieru ok nobed gi miwafu ne owadgi owuon kata mana ne chiege mohero kata nyithinde modongʼ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kendo ok enomi ngʼato angʼata ringre nyathineno ma en owuon ochamo nikech mano kende e gima nodongʼ bangʼ ka wasigu osemonjo miechu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhako makare kendo man-gi lony mamalo e dieru, ngʼat modimbore kendo man-gi ngʼwono malach ma bende ok osewuotho e lowo gi tiende nono, nobed ka iye kwar kod chwore owuon kata mana gi yawuote kod nyige ma en owuon ema onywolo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Notamre pogonegi kata mana bieche owuon bangʼ nywol, nimar oparo mondo ochamgi lingʼ-lingʼ e ndalo ma wasiku nogonu agengʼa ka masira olworo miechu madongo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.57"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ok urito weche duto manie chikni ma ondiki e kitabuni kendo ka ok uchiwo luor ne nyinge man-gi teko ma en Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye biro kelo masiche malich kuomu kaachiel gi nyikwau, tuoche maywayo dend ji kuom kinde mangʼeny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obiro keto kuomu tuoche duto mag Misri ma uluoro kendo ginibed kuomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye nokel kuomu kit tuoche duto ma ok ondiki e kitabuni mar chik nyaka chop tieku chuth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Un ma ungʼeny ka sulwe manie polo unudongʼ matin nikech ne ok urito chike Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana kaka ne omoro Jehova Nyasaye mondo omiu gweth kendo ubed mangʼeny, e kaka obiro bedo gi mor ka oranou kendo otiekou. Notieku e piny ma udonjoe mondo ukaw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.63"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka Jehova Nyasaye nokewu e pinje duto, koa e tungʼ piny konchiel nyaka machielo. Kanyo unulamie nyiseche mamoko, ma gin nyiseche mopa mag yiende kod kite ma un uwegi kod ka kwereu ne ok ongʼeyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.64"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "65",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:65"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "65",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E kind pinjego ok unuyudie hoch kata yweyo ka ombongʼ tiendeu ool. Kuno Jehova Nyasaye nomiu paro maliw, wangʼ maneno ka ool gi dwaro to gi chuny machandore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.65",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.65"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "66",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:66"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "66",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unudag ka ukia gima biro timorenu; ka un gilworo odiechiengʼ kod otieno, ka ukia gima biro timore ne ngimau.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.66",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.66"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "67",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:67"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "67",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka piny oru gokinyi unuwach niya, \"Mad ne bedni en odhiambo\" kendo godhiambo unuwach niya, \"Mad ne piny bed ni en okinyi\" nikech masira ma unune nopongʼ chunyu kod gik ma wengeu none.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.67",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.67"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "68",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 28:68"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "68",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye nooru dok Misri gi yiedhi, e wuoth mane awacho ni ok onego udhiye. Kuno unuchiwru ne wasiku kaka chwo kod mon ma jotich to onge ngʼama noyie ngʼiewou.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.28.68",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.28.68"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
